    "title": "Men's Moab 3 Hiking Shoes",
    "description": "The Merrell Men's Moab 3 Hiking Shoes are durable and supportive outdoor shoes designed for hiking and trail walking. They feature a pigskin leather and mesh upper for breathability, combined with a protective toe cap and bellows tongue to keep debris out. For comfort and stability, the shoes include a Kinetic Fit® ADVANCED removable contoured insole, a molded nylon arch shank, and a Merrell Air Cushion® in the heel. The lightweight EVA foam midsole provides additional cushioning, while the grippy Vibram® TC5+ rubber outsole ensures enhanced traction on various terrains.",
